diff --git a/changelog/7490.bugfix.rst b/changelog/7490.bugfix.rst
new file mode 100644
index 000000000..46b507ed2
--- /dev/null
+++ b/changelog/7490.bugfix.rst
@@ -0,0 +1,3 @@
+Fixed a regression where dynamically adding an ``xfail`` mark during a test
+(e.g. via ``request.node.add_marker``) was no longer honored, causing the test
+to be reported as a failure instead of xfailed.
